# Fail-safe root-cause agent

When launched by Auto Fail-Safe Bot:

1. Work on the existing PR branch only.
2. Fix the automation/workflow/script root cause that made PR Automation fail.
3. Validate changes (`bash -n` for shell, workflow YAML sanity).
4. Commit and push to the same branch.
5. Remove `fail-safe:blocked` and `fail-safe:agent-fixing` labels.
6. Comment on the PR with the fix summary.
7. Re-run: `gh workflow run pr-automation.yml -f pr_number=<n>`

Do not invent product features or edit unrelated docs.
